{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the pixel pitch of the VP Stage Ultra 0.9mm?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The VP Stage Ultra features an ultra-fine pixel pitch of 0.93mm, delivering exceptional resolution ideal for close-up virtual production and detailed visual effects.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does this LED display handle color accuracy and HDR support?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It supports HDR10+ and Dolby Vision with a 20-bit color depth and 98% DCI-P3 color gamut, ensuring Hollywood-grade color fidelity and dynamic range necessary for professional film and TV productions.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the VP Stage Ultra 0.9mm be used in outdoor or high ambient light environments?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"With a brightness of 1,200 nits, this display is optimized for controlled studio environments rather than direct outdoor sunlight, offering excellent visibility and color reproduction in indoor virtual production setups.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty and support options are available for this product?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx offers comprehensive warranty packages and dedicated technical support to ensure uptime and performance in demanding production schedules. Detailed warranty terms vary; please contact us for specifics.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does this product compare to other virtual production LEDs with higher pixel pitches?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The VP Stage Ultra's 0.93mm pitch eliminates moire artifacts at any camera distance, outperforming higher pitch displays that may show visible pixel structure. Its real-time per-pixel calibration and low latency provide superior image stability and accuracy.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is installation complex for the VP Stage Ultra 0.9mm panels?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Installation requires professional setup due to precise calibration and alignment needs, but the modular design allows flexible configurations for feature films, commercials, and high-end TV studios.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What types of productions is this display best suited for?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It is ideal for virtual production in feature films, commercials, and high-end television where ultra-high resolution, color accuracy, and HDR compliance are critical.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the typical latency for real-time virtual production applications?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The VP Stage Ultra offers latency under 0.5 frames, ensuring seamless, real-time visual feedback during live filming and compositing.\"}}]}5:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$f\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$10\"}}],\"$L11\",\"$L12\",\"$L13\"],\"$L14\"]}]\n11:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"BreadcrumbList\\\", \\\"itemListElement\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 1, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Home\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 2, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Products\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 3, \\\"name\\\": \\\"VP Stage Ultra 0.9mm\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-vpx093\\\"}]}\"}}]\n12:[\"$\",\"script\",\"3\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"legalName\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"contactPoint\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ContactPoint\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"contactType\\\": \\\"sales\\\", \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"AE\\\", \\\"SA\\\", \\\"QA\\\", \\\"KW\\\", \\\"BH\\\", \\\"OM\\\"], \\\"availableLanguage\\\": [\\\"en\\\", \\\"ar\\\"]}}\"}}]\n13:[\"$\",\"script\",\"4\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"LocalBusiness\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"image\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"priceRange\\\": \\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\u00b2\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\", \\\"Thursday\\\", \\\"Friday\\\", \\\"Saturday\\\"], \\\"opens\\\": \\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}]\n15:T63e,<h1>VP Stage Ultra 0.9mm</h1><p>Experience ultra-fine VP Stage Ultra 0.9mm LED displays in Dubai. Contact Brightluxx UAE for premium quality LED solutions today!</p><p><strong>0.9mm. Hollywood-grade virtual production.</strong></p><p>The highest resolution LED volume on the market. 0.9mm COB pitch eliminates moire at any camera distance. Used in A-list film and commercial productions. HDR-capable with real-time color calibration for seamless compositing.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the pixel pitch of the VP Stage Ultra 0.9mm?</h3><p>The VP Stage Ultra features an ultra-fine pixel pitch of 0.93mm, delivering exceptional resolution ideal for close-up virtual production and detailed visual effects.</p><h3>How does this LED display handle color accuracy and HDR support?</h3><p>It supports HDR10+ and Dolby Vision with a 20-bit color depth and 98% DCI-P3 color gamut, ensuring Hollywood-grade color fidelity and dynamic range necessary for professional film and TV productions.</p><h3>Can the VP Stage Ultra 0.9mm be used in outdoor or high ambient light environments?</h3><p>With a brightness of 1,200 nits, this display is optimized for controlled studio environments rather than direct outdoor sunlight, offering excellent visibility and color reproduction in indoor virtual production setups.</p><h3>What warranty and support options are available for this product?</h3><p>Brightluxx offers comprehensive warranty packages and dedicated technical support to ensure uptime and performance in demanding production schedules. Detailed warranty terms vary; please contact us for specifics.</p>14:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$15\"}}]\nb:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"