"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the pixel pitch of the VP Stage Ultra 0.9mm?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The VP Stage Ultra features an ultra-fine pixel pitch of 0.93mm, delivering exceptional resolution ideal for close-up virtual production and detailed visual effects.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does this LED display handle color accuracy and HDR support?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It supports HDR10+ and Dolby Vision with a 20-bit color depth and 98% DCI-P3 color gamut, ensuring Hollywood-grade color fidelity and dynamic range necessary for professional film and TV productions.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the VP Stage Ultra 0.9mm be used in outdoor or high ambient light environments?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"With a brightness of 1,200 nits, this display is optimized for controlled studio environments rather than direct outdoor sunlight, offering excellent visibility and color reproduction in indoor virtual production setups.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty and support options are available for this product?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx offers comprehensive warranty packages and dedicated technical support to ensure uptime and performance in demanding production schedules. Detailed warranty terms vary; please contact us for specifics.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does this product compare to other virtual production LEDs with higher pixel pitches?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The VP Stage Ultra's 0.93mm pitch eliminates moire artifacts at any camera distance, outperforming higher pitch displays that may show visible pixel structure. Its real-time per-pixel calibration and low latency provide superior image stability and accuracy.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is installation complex for the VP Stage Ultra 0.9mm panels?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Installation requires professional setup due to precise calibration and alignment needs, but the modular design allows flexible configurations for feature films, commercials, and high-end TV studios.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What types of productions is this display best suited for?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It is ideal for virtual production in feature films, commercials, and high-end television where ultra-high resolution, color accuracy, and HDR compliance are critical.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the typical latency for real-time virtual production applications?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The VP Stage Ultra offers latency under 0.5 frames, ensuring seamless, real-time visual feedback during live filming and compositing.\"}}]}5:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$f\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$10\"}}],\"$L11\",\"$L12\",\"$L13\"],\"$L14\"]}]\n11:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"BreadcrumbList\\\", \\\"itemListElement\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 1, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Home\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 2, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Products\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 3, \\\"name\\\": \\\"VP Stage Ultra 0.9mm\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-vpx093\\\"}]}\"}}]\n12:[\"$\",\"script\"